  "notes": [
    "GeoStrata core ownership means Minecraft placed-feature generation is suppressed for the vanilla ores and lithology blobs that GeoStrata replaces.",
    "Vanilla granite, diorite and andesite are coherent volcanic-arc bodies; tuff forms shallow pyroclastic halos; calcite occurs as thin crystalline-carbonate beds; natural basalt resolves to minecraft:basalt while the legacy geostrata:basalt block remains registered for existing worlds.",
